{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-training-certification-rampup","title":"坐席培训、认证考核与上线爬坡（ramp-up）节奏管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-cs-bpo-outsourcing/outsourcer-enablement/agent-training-certification-rampup","wordCount":3232,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"坐席培训-认证考核与上线爬坡-ramp-up-节奏管理\">坐席培训、认证考核与上线爬坡（ramp-up）节奏管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>交钥匙外包最常见的失败不是&quot;招不到人&quot;，而是<strong>把入职培训当成一段日历时长而非一道准入闸门</strong>。启用蓝图交付了 SOP、话术与知识库（见同章《外包启用蓝图与知识移交》），但资产不会自动变成产能：一名新坐席从&quot;读完资料&quot;到&quot;可独立、可审计地处理真实工单&quot;，中间隔着一套分层的<strong>培训—认证—爬坡</strong>流水线。节奏管理管的就是这条流水线上每一段的时间预算、通过判据与放量速度。</p>\n<p>三个概念必须先分清：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>培训（training）</strong> 是知识输入，衡量覆盖率和测评分数，属可控变量。</li>\n<li><strong>认证（certification）</strong> 是<strong>准入闸门</strong>——未通过者不上线，衡量通过率与判分一致性（inter-rater reliability）。它是培训与生产之间的硬边界，不是&quot;培训完成即可上线&quot;的软过渡。</li>\n<li><strong>爬坡（ramp-up）</strong> 是认证通过后的<strong>产能曲线</strong>，衡量每批次的生产力比率与质量达标率。新坐席在这一段是&quot;低产能高监督成本&quot;的资源，排班与计费必须反映这一点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>COPC 客户体验标准（COPC CX Standard）把招聘、培训与辅导（recruiting, training and coaching）放在&quot;Managing Processes&quot;支柱下，与知识、质量、供应商管理同一评估框架内（来源：copc.com）。这一归类的含义是：培训治理与质量治理不是两件事，认证判据必须与后续质检（QA）评分口径同源，否则会出现&quot;通过认证的人上线后被质检大量扣分&quot;的口径打架。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[入职 Onboarding&lt;br/&gt;合规/系统/文化] --&gt; B[产品与政策&lt;br/&gt;Product &amp; Policy]&#10;  B --&gt; C[系统与工具&lt;br/&gt;CRM/工单/知识库]&#10;  C --&gt; D[软技能与话术&lt;br/&gt;Soft Skills &amp; Tone]&#10;  D --&gt; E{认证闸门&lt;br/&gt;Gateway Certification}&#10;  E --&gt;|未通过| R[补训 Recycle&lt;br/&gt;延时再考]&#10;  R --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|通过| F[影子坐席 Nesting&lt;br/&gt;旁听+预测+带教]&#10;  F --&gt; G[分批爬坡 Ramp&lt;br/&gt;批次放量]&#10;  G --&gt; H[稳态 Steady State&lt;br/&gt;常规排班与计费]\">graph TD\n  A[入职 Onboarding&lt;br/&gt;合规/系统/文化] --&gt; B[产品与政策&lt;br/&gt;Product &amp; Policy]\n  B --&gt; C[系统与工具&lt;br/&gt;CRM/工单/知识库]\n  C --&gt; D[软技能与话术&lt;br/&gt;Soft Skills &amp; Tone]\n  D --&gt; E{认证闸门&lt;br/&gt;Gateway Certification}\n  E --&gt;|未通过| R[补训 Recycle&lt;br/&gt;延时再考]\n  R --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|通过| F[影子坐席 Nesting&lt;br/&gt;旁听+预测+带教]\n  F --&gt; G[分批爬坡 Ramp&lt;br/&gt;批次放量]\n  G --&gt; H[稳态 Steady State&lt;br/&gt;常规排班与计费]</pre><p>上图中 <code>E</code> 与 <code>F</code> 的先后在实践中有两种排法：先考后陪（认证不过不进影子期）或先陪后考（影子期内累积判分再定认证）。多语种外包更常用后者，因为语言与语气的判断只能在真实会话中暴露；但无论哪种排法，<strong>认证必须是显式判据，而非&quot;影子期结束即通过&quot;的默认</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"培训路径的分层设计\">培训路径的分层设计</h2><p>把培训拆成层，不是因为好看，而是因为每一层的<strong>通过判据不同、可外包程度不同、纠错成本不同</strong>。下表给出多语种客服外包的典型分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>典型时长（新坐席）</th>\n<th>通过判据</th>\n<th>纠错成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 入职与合规</td>\n<td>数据保护、保密、行为准则、甲方企业政策</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n<td>合规测验（必过、可重考）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 产品与政策</td>\n<td>商品/服务知识、退款退货规则、升级判据</td>\n<td>3–10 天</td>\n<td>政策情景选择题 + 判据解释</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 系统与工具</td>\n<td>CRM、工单系统、知识库检索、内部 IM</td>\n<td>2–5 天</td>\n<td>模拟工单在沙盒中完成</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 软技能与话术</td>\n<td>语气、同理、去激化、跨文化表达</td>\n<td>2–5 天</td>\n<td>角色扮演评分</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L5 认证与影子</td>\n<td>情景测试 + 旁听真实会话</td>\n<td>5–15 天</td>\n<td>认证闸门（见下节）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时长<strong>不能照搬甲方自营中心</strong>：自营坐席熟悉品牌与内部语言，外包坐席缺少大量隐性上下文（谁是谁、哪个部门管什么、历史政策如何演变），所以 L2 与 L4 通常更长。排预算时应在合同启用里程碑里按&quot;场景 × 语言&quot;分别给出时长，而非笼统的&quot;两周培训&quot;。分层设计的纪律是<strong>每一层结束都要有可判定的测评，而非讲师签字</strong>——没有测评的层会向后传递缺陷：L2 没测透政策判据，L4 就会基于错误理解展开，到认证闸门才集中爆雷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"认证考核-从情景测试到影子坐席\">认证考核：从情景测试到影子坐席</h2><p>认证闸门的核心是<strong>判分口径与生产质检同源</strong>。若认证用一套自编评分表、质检用另一套，坐席会学到&quot;应付考试&quot;的行为而非&quot;可通过质检&quot;的行为。成熟做法是让认证评分表复用质检评分表的维度（准确性、合规、语气、效率、升级正确性），只调整权重与容错阈值。</p>\n<p>认证通常由三部分构成，各自解决不同的失效模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>情景测试（scenario test）</strong>：覆盖正常、边界、升级判定三类场景。边界场景（话术未覆盖、政策含糊、客户情绪激烈）是重点——只考正常场景会让坐席在真实边界面前自由发挥，而自由发挥正是政策漂移的源头。</li>\n<li><strong>影子坐席（nesting / shadowing）</strong>：旁听真实会话并对结果做预测，与真实处理结果比对。一致率高说明坐席已建立正确判据模型；一致率低说明&quot;读懂了但判断错&quot;，这是笔试测不出的。</li>\n<li><strong>带教评分（coaching sign-off）</strong>：带教组长对坐席的实时陪同（side-by-side）表现给分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>多语种场景下，认证还要额外验证<strong>语言保真度</strong>：坐席不仅要答对政策，还要用目标语言讲得自然且不失真，这需要该语言的母语评分者参与，与启用阶段的&quot;母语者终审&quot;纪律一致。</p>\n<p>认证判据要写成可复核的形式：<strong>通过 = 各维度加权分 ≥ 阈值 且 无单项合规否决</strong>。合规项（如数据保护、承诺越权）通常设为一票否决，即总分再高也判不通过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爬坡节奏-分批放量与产能曲线\">爬坡节奏：分批放量与产能曲线</h2><p>通过认证不等于满产能。新坐席在爬坡期的处理时长（AHT）更长、一次解决率（FCR）更低、升级更多，生产力随时间上升。行业通用做法是<strong>分批（cohort）放量</strong>：比如首批放核定人力的 10%–25%，观察质量与效率，再逐批放大，直到满编。</p>\n<p>爬坡期的<strong>有效产能远低于名义人头</strong>，可用下式估算混合团队的生产力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>blended</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{blended}}(t) = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N} r\\bigl(t - t_i\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为在编坐席数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 名坐席开始爬坡的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为该坐席自爬坡起第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 天相对满产的<strong>生产力比率曲线</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示达到稳态）。当团队里既有老坐席又有新坐席时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>blended</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{blended}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">blended</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才反映真实可排班的产能力。用名义人头 × 满产 AHT 排班，是爬坡期最典型的排班错误。</p>\n<p>再进一步，若要在预算里体现新坐席的&quot;净贡献&quot;，可估算单个新坐席的<strong>摊销成本</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>hire</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>recruit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>train</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>Y</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ramp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{hire}} = \\frac{C_{\\text{recruit}} + C_{\\text{train}} \\cdot n}{Y} + C_{\\text{ramp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hire</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recruit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vl